values ('WWLWAIPA', '017', '2026-07-01', 'Fixed + volumetric (metered)', 1741.9, 2.9795, null, null, null, '2026-11-26', 'Adopted Annual Plan 2026/27 rates: potable water $257.90 fixed + $2.9795/m³ (raw water $0.7448/m³); wastewater $1,484 per connected properties (sample-property tables). FIXED = water $257.90 + wastewater $1,484. Delivered by Waikato Waters Ltd from 1 July 2026. Only the Arohena rural water scheme (administered by Otorohanga) is value-based: 0.0071 cents per $ of capital value.', 'https://www.waipadc.govt.nz/repository/libraries/id:26zgz4o7s1cxbyk7hfo7/hierarchy/our-council/Strategies%20and%20plans/annual-plan/documents/2026-27%20Annual%20Plan.pdf', 'https://www.waipadc.govt.nz/repository/libraries/id:26zgz4o7s1cxbyk7hfo7/hierarchy/our-council/Strategies%20and%20plans/annual-plan/documents/2026-27%20Annual%20Plan.pdf', null, true, null)
