values ('QLDC', '070', '2026-07-01', 'Fixed + capital value (water); fixed per toilet (sewerage)', 1519.78, null, null, 0.00019846, 'capital value', '2026-11-26', 'Rates and charges 2026/27 (Attachment A), Queenstown and District scheme: water $340 fixed + 0.00019846 per $ of capital value (table headed ''cents in the $'' but the magnitude is dollars per dollar: about $198 per $1M of capital value); sewerage $1,179.78 for the first toilet. FIXED = $340 + $1,179.78. Other schemes: water fixed Arrowtown $280, Wanaka $260, Arthurs Point $420, Glenorchy $550, Hawea $280, with capital-value rates 0.00026092 to 0.00089313; sewerage Wanaka $1,173.51, Arrowtown $1,107.88, Hawea $893.55, Lake Hayes $875.18.', 'https://www.qldc.govt.nz/media/nhyjbj3q/2a-attachment-a-proposed-rates-and-charges-for-2026-2027.pdf', 'https://www.qldc.govt.nz/media/nhyjbj3q/2a-attachment-a-proposed-rates-and-charges-for-2026-2027.pdf', 'https://www.qldc.govt.nz/services/rates-property', true, null)
