values ('CTNDC', '049', '2026-07-01', 'Fixed + volumetric (metered above 225 m³/yr)', 2219.78, 2.16, 616.0, null, null, '2026-11-26', 'Annual Plan 2026/27 rates: urban water $958.79 per household (metered, connected; $479.40 if able to connect); wastewater $1,260.99 per household connected ($630.50 able to connect; $1,260.99 per extra toilet). $2.16/m³ for water over 225 m³ a year (THRESHOLD = 225 m³/yr = 616 L/day). FIXED = $958.79 + $1,260.99. Only the Waingawa industrial-zone wastewater is value-based: 0.21901 cents per $ of capital value (non-residential 0.10950).', 'https://cdc.govt.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/FINAL_2026_27-Annual-Plan_website.pdf', 'https://cdc.govt.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/FINAL_2026_27-Annual-Plan_website.pdf', 'https://cdc.govt.nz/services/rates/', true, null)
