values ('TMRDC', '064', '2026-07-01', 'Fixed per connection (urban); rural schemes per unit or hectare', 1301.25, null, null, null, null, '2026-11-26', 'Resolution to Set Rates 2026/27: urban water $844.52 per household connected; wastewater $456.73 per toilet (a household counts as one). FIXED = $844.52 + $456.73. Rural schemes: per unit of water (Te Moana Downs $543.43, Orari $653.51) or per hectare (Rangitata-Orari $19.21, Seadown $45.80, Beautiful Valley $22.39).', 'https://www.timaru.govt.nz/__data/assets/pdf_file/0006/1156956/Resolution-to-Set-Rates-2026-27.pdf', 'https://www.timaru.govt.nz/__data/assets/pdf_file/0006/1156956/Resolution-to-Set-Rates-2026-27.pdf', 'https://www.timaru.govt.nz/services/rates-and-property/rates-information', true, null)
