values ('CCC', '060', '2026-07-01', 'Capital value + excess water', null, 1.52, 900.0, 0.00165949, 'capital value', '2026-11-26', '2026/27 targeted rates: water supply 0.073559 cents per $ of capital value (half charge 0.036780 if serviceable, not connected); sewerage 0.092390 cents per $ of capital value. VALUE_RATE = 0.00073559 + 0.00092390 dollars per dollar (about $1,660 per $1M of capital value; $1,162 for a $700,000 house). Excess residential water $1.52/m³ above 900 L/day (allowance per a third-party calculator). No fixed water or sewerage charge; the earlier ''fixed $1,402.26'' was an average of capital-value rates.', 'https://christchurch.infocouncil.biz/Open/2026/06/CAPL_20260623_MIN_10938_AT.HTM', 'https://christchurch.infocouncil.biz/Open/2026/06/CAPL_20260623_MIN_10938_AT.HTM', 'https://www.ccc.govt.nz/services/rates-and-valuations/setting-rates-and-valuations/setting-rates', true, null)
