values ('TIAKIWAI', null, '2026-07-01', 'Fixed + capital value (Wellington, Upper Hutt water); fixed per household or per toilet (Hutt, Porirua); volumetric if metered', 645.89, null, null, 0.00131423, 'capital value', '2026-11-26', 'Provider-wide summary; each territory has its own row (Wellington 047, Hutt 046, Porirua 044, Upper Hutt 045). 2026/27, from the billing page calculator''s embedded rates, checked against the Pricing Policy (1 July 2026) and the year-one charging page. Headline figures are Wellington City residential: water $442 + 0.00067964 per $ of capital value, wastewater $203.89 + 0.00063459 per $ of capital value (FIXED and VALUE_RATE = water + wastewater); metered water $359.21 + $7.79/m³. Hutt City: water $1000 per household (metered $1000 + $5.35/m³), wastewater $1014 per household. Porirua: water $912.66 per household (metered $4.63/m³), wastewater $1134.06 per toilet (one per home). Upper Hutt: water $771 + 0.0002348 per $ of capital value (metered $771 + $3.37/m³), wastewater $770.56 per toilet. Stormwater is billed too (fixed + per $ of capital value) but excluded from FIXED. Full parameters in TARIFF_JSON; the app''s estimator uses them.', 'https://qpulse.wellingtonwater.co.nz/QPulseDocumentService/Documents.svc/documents/active/attachment?number=POL_0416', 'https://qpulse.wellingtonwater.co.nz/QPulseDocumentService/Documents.svc/documents/active/attachment?number=POL_0416', 'https://www.tiakiwai.co.nz/billing', true, '{"model":"tiakiwai-2026-27","source":"Tiaki Wai billing page calculator (data-rates), checked against the Tiaki Wai Pricing Policy 1 July 2026","rates":{"WCC":{"waterMeterFixed":359.21,"waterMeterRate":7.79,"waterResFixed":442,"waterResCVRate":0.00067964,"waterComFixed":1016.75,"waterComCVRate":0.00780448,"wwResFixed":203.89,"wwResCVRate":0.00063459,"wwComFixed":1134.2,"wwComCVRate":0.00273571,"swResFixed":67.39,"swResCVRate":0.00052241,"swComFixed":67.39,"swComCVRate":0.00076842},"HCC":{"waterMeterFixed":1000,"waterMeterRate":5.35,"waterSUIPFixed":1000,"wwSUIPFixed":1014,"wwPanFixedAdditional":507,"swResFixed":41,"swResCVRate":0.00036509,"swComFixed":41,"swComCVRateCentral":0.00112893,"swComCVRateSuburban":0.00102439},"PCC":{"waterMeterRate":4.63,"waterSUIPFixed":912.66,"wwPanFixed":1134.06,"swResFixed":25.1,"swResCVRate":0.00023971,"swComFixed":25.1,"swComCVRates":{"business_differential":0.00074309,"business_park":0.00047941,"motel":0.00034038,"shopping_plaza":0.00074309,"vacant_land":0.00107868}},"UHCC":{"waterMeterFixed":771,"waterMeterRateRes":3.37,"waterMeterRateCom":3.37,"waterNoMeterFixed":771,"waterNoMeterCVRate":0.0002348,"wwPanFixed":770.56,"swResFixed":28.44,"swResCVRate":0.00030947,"swComFixed":28.44,"swComCVRate":0.00043326}}}'::jsonb)
