values ('IAWAIHAM', '016', '2026-07-01', 'Fixed + capital value (residential); metered water volumetric', 42.0, 2.61, null, 0.00148824, 'capital value', '2026-11-27', 'Commerce Commission charges disclosure (IAWAI, 27 Oct 2026; from Final Fees and Charges 2026/27): Hamilton City residential water $28/yr fixed + $0.00075256 per $ of capital value (multi-residential $0.00082782); wastewater $14/yr fixed + $0.00073568 per $ of capital value. FIXED = $28 + $14; VALUE_RATE = water + wastewater (about $1,488 per $1M capital value). Water by meter $2.61/m³ (metered customers). Commercial non-metered water $628/yr.', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/iawai-prod-web-assets/public/Uploads/Documents/ComCom.-Fees-and-charges-disclosures.-27-October-2026.pdf', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/iawai-prod-web-assets/public/Uploads/Documents/ComCom.-Fees-and-charges-disclosures.-27-October-2026.pdf', 'https://iawai.co.nz/your-water/fees-and-charges', true, null)
