values ('WTKDC', '068', '2026-07-01', 'Fixed per connection + metered (Oamaru)', null, 1.8, null, null, null, '2026-11-26', 'Resolution to set the rates 2026/27 (as indexed): Oamaru water supply $507 per connection; Oamaru metered water $1.80/m³ (all zones); Waihemo Palmerston zone $1,383; rural schemes per connection (Tokarahi $655, Awamoko $796). Wastewater charge not confirmed, so FIXED (water + wastewater) left blank.', 'https://www.waitaki.govt.nz/files/content/public/v/2/news/rates-information-2026-2027/resolution-to-set-the-rates-for-the-2026-27-rating-year.pdf', 'https://www.waitaki.govt.nz/files/content/public/v/2/news/rates-information-2026-2027/resolution-to-set-the-rates-for-the-2026-27-rating-year.pdf', 'https://www.waitaki.govt.nz/News/Rates-Information-2026-2027', false, null)
