values ('DCC', '071', '2026-07-01', 'Fixed per connection (drainage combines sewage and stormwater)', 1594.32, null, null, null, null, '2026-11-26', '2026/27 Rating Method / FIS: drainage targeted rate $1,003.10 per connected residential unit ($501.55 serviceable), 78% sewage and 22% stormwater; water $811.90 per connected unit (from the earlier record). FIXED = water $811.90 + 78% of drainage ($782.42). Water also has volume/quantity rates for metered or extraordinary supply. Commercial drainage on capital value.', 'https://www.dunedin.govt.nz/__data/assets/pdf_file/0003/1288821/2026-27-Rating-Method-Funding-Impact-Statement.pdf', 'https://www.dunedin.govt.nz/__data/assets/pdf_file/0003/1288821/2026-27-Rating-Method-Funding-Impact-Statement.pdf', 'https://www.dunedin.govt.nz/council/annual-and-long-term-plans/9-year-plan-2025-2034/section-4/rating-information', false, null)
