values ('SELWYN', '062', '2026-07-01', 'Fixed + volumetric (billed by Selwyn Water)', null, null, null, null, null, '2026-11-26', 'From 1 July 2026 Selwyn Water bills drinking water and wastewater directly. Draft 2026/27 pricing: about $1,831 a year for an average urban household on 257 m³ (water + wastewater; was $1,552), about $879 for drinking water only; less with lower use. Component prices (fixed, per m³) not found, so figures left blank.', 'https://www.selwyn.govt.nz/news-And-events/news/selwyn-water-strategy-clarifies-future-charges-and-lowers-projected-increase', 'https://www.selwyn.govt.nz/news-And-events/news/selwyn-water-strategy-clarifies-future-charges-and-lowers-projected-increase', 'https://www.selwyn.govt.nz/services/water/selwyn-water-limited', false, null)
