values ('WGNDC', '037', '2026-07-01', 'Not yet confirmed for 2026/27 (council rates by property value)', null, null, null, null, null, '2026-11-27', 'Whanganui''s Commerce Commission disclosure (1 Sep 2026) refers to the Annual Plan 2026/27 rating funding impact statement for charges, which is not yet published in final form; the 2026 rates newsletter says rates are shared across properties by property value and gives figures only as images. The earlier ''fixed $1,069'' was a 2025/26 sample property (water $347 + wastewater $722), not a fixed charge, so no fixed amount is recorded. Joint water services organisation with Ruapehu from 1 July 2027.', 'https://www.whanganui.govt.nz/files/assets/public/v/1/guides-and-information/whanganui-district-council-water-services-information-disclosure-determination-2026.pdf', 'https://www.whanganui.govt.nz/files/assets/public/v/1/guides-and-information/whanganui-district-council-water-services-information-disclosure-determination-2026.pdf', 'https://www.whanganui.govt.nz/Property-and-Rates/Rates/202526-rates-breakdown', false, null)
